extends ../layout

block content
  .d-flex.flex-column.mb-5
    p.lead.text-center
      | Some projects I've built or contributed to.

  .row.mb-4
    .col-lg-4.mb-4.mb-lg-0
      .card.h-100
        img.card-img-top(src="https://storage.googleapis.com/mateo-website-bucket/hackerspace-gent-website.png" alt="Hackerspace Gent Website" style="object-fit: cover; max-height: 300px;")
        .card-body
          h5.card-title Hackerspace Gent Website
          .d-flex.gap-2.mb-3
            a.btn(href="https://hackerspace.gent/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="background-color: #FF8040; color: #212529; border: none;") Live Site
            a.btn(href="https://github.com/0x20/website-node" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="background-color: #333; color: white; border: none;")
              svg(xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="margin-right: 6px;")
                path(d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.012 8.012 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z")
              | GitHub
          p.card-text.mb-3
            | Website for Hackerspace Gent (0x20), a community space for hackers, makers, and tinkerers in Ghent, Belgium.
            | Built on Bloemist's initial design, featuring an event system powered by markdown files.
          .feature-list
            .feature-item
              span.feature-label Node.js
              span  with Express
            .feature-item
              span.feature-label Deployed
              span  on Azure
            .feature-item
              span.feature-label GitHub Actions
              span  for events

  style.
    .feature-list {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .feature-item {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .feature-label {
      color: #2196F3;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
